{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;HEY, YOUR TRUCK STILL OPEN?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a <strong>food truck in the post-apocalypse</strong>, serving <strong>bizarre meals</strong> to even stranger customers. Can you survive the high-pressure horrors of both the apocalyptic wasteland and customer service all at once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess up too many orders, serve the wrong freaks, or let something slip past you, and stress will pile up fast. <strong>Hit your limit, and it\u2019s lights out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.poster.avif?t=1770486564\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.webm?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.mp4?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;YOU GOT FOOD? I GOT MOUTH.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry weirdos</strong> are lining up, and it\u2019s your job to feed their <strong>freaky appetites</strong>. Toast, bowls, and shish kebabs - raw, cooked, rotten or radioactive - you've got to keep up! But sometimes, you'll simply need to <strong>feed them a bullet</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all part of the gig. <strong>Keep your truck moving</strong>, <strong>manage your limited resources</strong>,\u00a0<strong>survive each stop</strong>, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll make it to that legendary non-irradiated beach on the horizon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.poster.avif?t=1770486564\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.webm?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.mp4?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748640?t=1770486564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/3c23382d54931fe314be09d2905da0563ca3e40a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770486564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/d6d878194a035483fb039995f4805e65e2aceda7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770486564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/d6d878194a035483fb039995f4805e65e2aceda7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770486564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3820720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Key Features</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your stress as you <strong>work the line</strong> and <strong>fend off the threats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable customers</strong> with weird requests and weirder appearances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0<strong>variety of wasteland locations</strong> with their own <strong>dangers and monsters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your truck</strong> and survive as you <strong>travel across the wasteland</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense</strong>, chaotic gameplay with a <strong>darkly humorous</strong> tone</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;HEY, YOUR TRUCK STILL OPEN?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a <strong>food truck in the post-apocalypse</strong>, serving <strong>bizarre meals</strong> to even stranger customers. Can you survive the high-pressure horrors of both the apocalyptic wasteland and customer service all at once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess up too many orders, serve the wrong freaks, or let something slip past you, and stress will pile up fast. <strong>Hit your limit, and it\u2019s lights out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.poster.avif?t=1770486564\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.webm?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/1ff7c42e5dc9181f2123a7aa37f99bc8.mp4?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;YOU GOT FOOD? I GOT MOUTH.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry weirdos</strong> are lining up, and it\u2019s your job to feed their <strong>freaky appetites</strong>. Toast, bowls, and shish kebabs - raw, cooked, rotten or radioactive - you've got to keep up! But sometimes, you'll simply need to <strong>feed them a bullet</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all part of the gig. <strong>Keep your truck moving</strong>, <strong>manage your limited resources</strong>,\u00a0<strong>survive each stop</strong>, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll make it to that legendary non-irradiated beach on the horizon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.poster.avif?t=1770486564\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.webm?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/8abf253e2487f2b9dcd49a13884f01d4.mp4?t=1770486564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CosmicDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/7790a3e490eb9069f320d0d346ae6f687a76e590/header.jpg?t=1770486564","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.40Ghz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048  MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500  MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.40Ghz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096  MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500  MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 (Sierra) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.40Ghz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong>